OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 31 Aug to Wed 9 Sep
OL,6,FLikely remaining unsettled with
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain
OL,8,Facross all areas at times. Rainfall
OL,9,Famounts will probably be above average
OL,10,Ffor the time year with the wettest
OL,11,Fconditions in the northwest. Potential
OL,12,Ffor some strong winds at times. Some
OL,13,Fdrier and more settled interludes
OL,14,Fcould develop, perhaps becoming longer
OL,15,Fin duration across southern areas
OL,16,Flater in this period. Temperatures are
OL,17,Flikely to be near average, although
OL,18,Fsome short-lived warm or very warm
OL,19,Fspells are possible, especially in the
OL,20,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
